  "derivation": {
    "framing": "Coalesced per-presence broadcast (NETWORKING.md §4 rule 2): one message per tick per presence containing the state of that presence's rebuilt interest set (its AoI neighbor set). Message bytes = envelopeBytes + recordBytes * interestPopulation.",
